                      "line": 6,
                      "heading": "Can I customize device configurations for different departments?"
                    },
                    "text": "Yes, configurations (apps, settings, asset tags) can be department or region-specific, managed via the booking portal or through your Account Manager."
                  }
                ],
                "sections": []
              },
              {
